oiler":false,"text":"学園の３年生。困窮する両親を救うため、愛人として売られることに同意した。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"心は優しいものの、意志が弱く、流されやすい。気弱な性格で、いつも困った小動物のような顔をしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな地味そうな見た目とは裏腹に、服の上からでもはっきり分かる、ドスケベな身体をしている。「このエロい身体を持つ気弱そうな女の子を、メチャクチャに犯して、子宮にたっぷり精子を注ぎ込んでやりたい」という男の妄想を、掻き立てずにはおかない女の子。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"74640"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/76/76392de0b764887658bc6808d4f713bd529dcee3b5542a7a1062d159d96f7731.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d2/d27fa0b0864c903dd703aa583789b38ac47a31682f6c157d52a440ed0e4345e6.webp","width":186,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"榎木実佳","creatorId":"vndb:s987","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s987","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s987","name":"榎木 実佳","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:298099:74640:10026:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c88068","characterName":"シスター九津見","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[],"egsCharacterIds":["22194"],"vndbCharacterId":"c88068"},"originalCharacterName":"シスター九津見","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The vice principal of St. Emilia Girls Academy as well as the leader of the prostitution circle. She gives direct orders to the protagonist Tomoya. Despite being a nun she isn't all that devoted, doesn't really believe in God and is always eager to have sex."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c88068"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園の副理事。裏でも売春組織を取り仕切っている。主人公に直接指示を出す立場の人。年齢は不詳だが、見た目は妖艶。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"服装こそシスターだが、信心などはまるでなく、少女たちを売ることも良心の呵責を覚えない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"セックスにも貪欲で、よく主人公に相手をさせている。"}],"source"