どこか憂いを帯びていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな彼女も、愛人として出荷されてしまったのだが、程なくして帰ってきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"不感症だから──という理由で。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23113","sourceWorkId":"29138","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"シリーズ三作目のヒロイン。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園の３年生。主人公のお付きのメイド。主人公は彼女に対して、どこか懐かしい感情を覚えるのだが、記憶が定かではない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公と同居していて、射精も含め、何かとお世話をしてくれる。優しい女の子だが、いつもどこか憂いを帯びていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな彼女も、愛人として出荷されてしまったのだが、程なくして帰ってきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"不感症だから──という理由で。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"74642"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ff/ff0f30f0a8e3f59e813cabfb4bbf9eefb374455f8d9789d81c3fda40d01c7bbc.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e7/e79378049aef705989650129659a2ec369049f8f531287cef6bb5120e3a0f9f0.webp","width":186,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"手塚 りょうこ","creatorId":"vndb:s646","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s646","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s646","name":"立石 めぐみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:83880","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c88067","characterName":"智哉","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c88067"},"originalCharacterName":"智哉","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A man who has lost his memory and has no idea why he even is at St. Emilia Girls Academy. He is also an orphan. Despite his current situation, Tomoya doesn't try to be pessimistic and just lets the days roll by while working."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is a member of the prostitute circle. His main job is to make the girls \"bloom\" (sexually train the